WEBVTT

00:00.680 --> 00:04.225
Meet the Town, a test environment for the emerging Internet of AI

00:04.250 --> 00:04.710
Agents.

00:04.940 --> 00:08.370
Today, most agents work inside closed systems.

00:08.460 --> 00:11.805
The vision is an open, decentralized web where different agents can

00:11.830 --> 00:13.630
interact across organizations.

00:13.860 --> 00:17.205
Imagine agents discovering one another, building trust,

00:17.230 --> 00:18.990
communicating, and collaborating.

00:19.220 --> 00:22.245
The town has twelve building blocks, or protocol layers.

00:22.270 --> 00:23.440
One, Transport.

00:23.510 --> 00:24.705
Two, Communication.

00:24.730 --> 00:25.875
Three, Identity.

00:25.900 --> 00:27.095
Four, Registry.

00:27.120 --> 00:28.150
Five, Auth.

00:28.180 --> 00:29.265
Six, Trust.

00:29.290 --> 00:30.535
Seven, Payments.

00:30.560 --> 00:31.755
Eight, Coordination.

00:31.780 --> 00:32.865
Nine, Negotiation.

00:32.890 --> 00:33.775
Ten, Memory.

00:33.800 --> 00:34.790
Eleven, Privacy.

00:34.850 --> 00:36.360
Twelve, Data Facts.

00:37.640 --> 00:39.650
Communication must go both ways.

00:39.760 --> 00:42.530
An agent can reach out, and another agent can call it back.

00:42.760 --> 00:46.055
In this vision, people build agents that represent them and transact

00:46.080 --> 00:46.770
directly.

00:46.800 --> 00:48.935
Agents could exchange intelligence.

00:48.960 --> 00:51.690
Knowledge pricing asks how to price and settle its value.

00:51.920 --> 00:53.775
The research spans three phases.

00:53.800 --> 00:58.065
Foundations, an agentic economy, and agentic societies, with services

00:58.090 --> 00:59.210
built for agents.

00:59.440 --> 01:03.385
The Town gives developers and researchers a sandbox to experiment

01:03.410 --> 01:07.415
with different agents, protocols, and governance before production.

01:07.440 --> 01:10.690
Markets and adversarial behavior are part of that exploration.

01:10.920 --> 01:15.150
A small experimental town can inform the technical, economic, and

01:15.210 --> 01:18.295
institutional foundations of a larger Agentic Web.

01:18.320 --> 01:21.410
Before building at planetary scale, begin with a town.

01:21.640 --> 01:24.080
To learn more, visit the website on screen.
